<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 78, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 56, paddingRight: 56, borderBottom: '2px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2430' }}>结果一：调参确实有用，但幅度有限</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>06 / 15</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 56, paddingRight: 56, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 56 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            只把模型宽度从 32 改成 64，别的全不动。左图是三次重复的成绩，右图是训练过程中的曲线。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34, marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 560, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src='assets/before_after.png' style={{ width: 530, height: 360, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A94A6', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    每一对柱子是同一个随机种子下的前后对比；三个种子都往右偏。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 560, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src='assets/loss_curves.png' style={{ width: 530, height: 360, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A94A6', marginTop: 2 }}>
                    训练误差一路下降，验证得分先升后平；第 20 轮已经不如第 19 轮。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 370, background: '#EDF3FF', padding: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1 }}>+0.0041</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>得分提升幅度</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 370, background: '#EDF3FF', padding: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1 }}>19 倍</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>提升 ÷ 种子波动</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 370, background: '#EDF3FF', padding: 14, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1 }}>3 / 3</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>三个种子全部同向</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6', marginTop: 10 }}>为什么强调「19 倍」而不是直接说「提升了」：0.004 这个数字本身，比运气波动还小的时候是没意义的。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 676, left: 56, width: 1168, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>MedMNIST 调参实验室 · 汇报 v2</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A94A6' }}>06 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
